WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
<v emeka valderrama>thank you for calling compass, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.067
<v yuki sandoval>hi, yeah, i need to reset my compass card pin.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:12.733
<v emeka valderrama>i can help. can i get your full name?

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.867
<v yuki sandoval>yuki sandoval.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.400
<v emeka valderrama>and for verification, your social security number?

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.000
<v yuki sandoval>it's nine one seven zero seven two six seven three.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.133
<v emeka valderrama>sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:29.133
<v yuki sandoval>917-07-2673.

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:32.600
<v emeka valderrama>thank you. and your date of birth?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.000
<v yuki sandoval>november 17, 2024.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.667
<v emeka valderrama>okay. the new card goes to the address in saltcoast?

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:48.600
<v yuki sandoval>yes. oh and my number changed, it's eight six zero... let me redo that, eight six nine five five five oh one oh one.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.267
<v emeka valderrama>got it. anything else?

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:58.333
<v yuki sandoval>no, wait, yes, i walked past a compass on the way here and remembered the branch closed.

00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:03.133
<v emeka valderrama>right, that branch closed last month. have a nice day.
